{"id":"n49300-1-6","stage":2,"title":"토하다 · 呕吐","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49300-1-6-1","ko":"속이 답답하고 토할 거 같아.","zh":"我觉得胸口闷，好像要吐了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"속이","meaning":"内脏，心口，肚子","explanation":"속：内脏，心口，肚子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"속","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71278","senseId":"3","lemma":"속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"속이","audio":"/audio/6f6688764f24b1ca69ac.mp3"}},{"text":"답답하고","meaning":"烦闷，堵得慌，发闷","explanation":"답답하다：烦闷，堵得慌，发闷；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"답답하다","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49437","senseId":"1","lemma":"답답하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"답답하고","audio":"/audio/48e6b5ad95166180e271.mp3"}},{"text":"토할","meaning":"呕吐","explanation":"토하다：呕吐；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"토하다","audio":"/audio/ebede831c778366b736f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49300","senseId":"1","lemma":"토하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토할","audio":"/audio/5f399747aa0ebc5c54b4.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"27e1c3f6a82b5a8b","term":"속","zh":"内脏，心口，肚子","audio":"/audio/27e1c3f6a82b5a8bcf92.mp3","entryId":"71278","definition":"人的身体中，腹部的内部或肠胃。","pronunciation":["속ː"]},{"id":"303de431f55bd88a","term":"답답하다","zh":"烦闷，堵得慌，发闷","audio":"/audio/303de431f55bd88a5993.mp3","entryId":"49437","definition":"像要窒息或难以呼吸。","pronunciation":["답따파다"]},{"id":"ebede831c778366b","term":"토하다","zh":"呕吐","audio":"/audio/ebede831c778366b736f.mp3","entryId":"49300","definition":"把服下去的食物吐出来。","pronunciation":["토ː하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ddcfca7d0ec39bee56ca.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49300-1-6-2","ko":"점심에 먹은 게 체했나 봐.","zh":"可能是中午吃的东西消化不良了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심에","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점심에","audio":"/audio/986cc2e503e6256b1f53.mp3"}},{"text":"먹은","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹은","audio":"/audio/1d859792bc976ecdc401.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"체했나","meaning":"积食，滞食，伤食","explanation":"체하다：积食，滞食，伤食；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"체하다","audio":"/audio/bd93c4a8e1a8fffbeb82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79176","senseId":"1","lemma":"체하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"체했나","audio":"/audio/e06bad52ee6f9eda99d2.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"bd93c4a8e1a8fffb","term":"체하다","zh":"积食，滞食，伤食","audio":"/audio/bd93c4a8e1a8fffbeb82.mp3","entryId":"79176","definition":"吃的食物不好消化，堵在肚子里。","pronunciation":["체하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9816c973cb03c6ecc2e4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.62,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49300","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":78,"sequenceScore":2.1721,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["可能是中午吃的东西消化不良了。","我觉得胸口闷，好像要吐了。","作品都做完了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得胸口闷，好像要吐了。","作品都做完了吗？","可能是中午吃的东西消化不良了。"],"answer":2}]}
